295
00:17:21,707 --> 00:17:23,309
Next wrestler.

296
00:17:24,877 --> 00:17:26,846
You'll be fine, you'll be fine.

297
00:17:50,236 --> 00:17:51,871
I think the momentum is slowly

298
00:17:51,938 --> 00:17:54,507
