346
00:21:44,937 --> 00:21:48,073
Don't be scared. Go for it! Go for it!

347
00:21:59,251 --> 00:22:01,487
No way, that pose?

348
00:22:01,554 --> 00:22:03,088
No, it can't be. No way.

349
00:22:03,155 --> 00:22:05,291
Not that pose… He wouldn't, right?

350
00:22:05,357 --> 00:22:07,059
Of course not. He has sense.

351
00:22:07,126 --> 00:22:09,862
No way he had a grade-schooler
