354
00:22:24,376 --> 00:22:27,213
Way to go! Looking good!

355
00:22:27,279 --> 00:22:30,549
What a fiery performance
by Hadurok-ri's young Kang Min-ho!

356
00:22:30,616 --> 00:22:34,186
-Awesome! Way to go!
-Wow, he's great! Love it!

357
00:22:34,253 --> 00:22:37,122
