is he possibly going to show us?

363
00:23:01,747 --> 00:23:03,949
My goodness, he's still so spry.

364
00:23:08,254 --> 00:23:11,090
2 times 1 is 2, 2 times 2 is 4.

365
00:23:11,156 --> 00:23:12,725
2 times 3 is 6.

366
00:23:12,791 --> 00:23:14,226
2 times 4 is 8.

367
00:23:14,293 --> 00:23:16,428
