369
00:23:19,298 --> 00:23:20,432
That's a talent?

370
00:23:20,499 --> 00:23:22,034
2 times 8 is 16.

371
00:23:22,101 --> 00:23:23,235
2 times 9 is 18.

372
00:23:27,973 --> 00:23:29,808
3 times 1 is 3, 3 times 2 is 6.

