00:23:29,875 --> 00:23:32,077
ACTUALLY MEMORIZED BY
MR. PARK GI-JUN, 102

374
00:23:32,144 --> 00:23:34,179
3 times 3 is 9, 3 times 4 is 12.

375
00:23:34,246 --> 00:23:35,581
3 times 5 is 15.

376
00:23:35,648 --> 00:23:37,449
3 times 6 is 18.

377
00:23:37,516 --> 00:23:39,251
4 times 1 is 4.

378
00:23:39,318 --> 00:23:41,220
4 times 2 is 8.

379
00:23:41,287 --> 00:23:42,888
4 times 3 is 12.

380
00:23:45,257 --> 00:23:47,459
9 times 1 is 9, 9 times 2 is 18.

381
00:23:47,526 --> 00:23:49,028
9 times 3 is 27.

382
00:23:49,094 --> 00:23:51,764
9 times 4 is 36.

383
00:23:51,830 --> 00:23:53,265
9 times 5 is 45.

384
00:23:53,332 --> 00:23:55,067
