397
00:24:41,180 --> 00:24:42,181
He can't even now.

398
00:24:42,247 --> 00:24:44,550
Hey, I just mix up the sevens, punk!

399
00:24:44,616 --> 00:24:45,985
I can recite it!

400
00:24:46,051 --> 00:24:47,453
Okay, okay. Still…

401
00:24:47,519 --> 00:24:50,322
Too bad, but Min-ho got second,
so that's a success.

402
00:24:50,923 --> 00:24:53,225
-How many points is second?
-70 points.

403
00:24:54,026 --> 00:24:55,194
70 points, huh.

404
00:24:55,961 --> 00:24:58,931
Sangdurok-ri didn't score
in the talent show.

405
