414
00:25:20,919 --> 00:25:22,821
Phew, you're right!

415
00:25:22,888 --> 00:25:24,723
See? What did I tell you?

416
00:25:24,790 --> 00:25:26,592
I told you it's not over yet!

417
00:25:26,658 --> 00:25:29,061
Now, up next is today's final event,

418
00:25:29,128 --> 00:25:33,632
