11-legged 100m team race.

419
00:25:33,699 --> 00:25:35,300
It's the last one. Let's go!

420
00:25:35,367 --> 00:25:37,669
Please gather at the starting line.

421
00:25:37,736 --> 00:25:39,505
Let's go, let's go!

422
00:25:40,272 --> 00:25:42,007
One, two.

423
00:25:43,409 --> 00:25:45,711
Everyone, stay sharp.

424
00:25:45,778 --> 00:25:48,981
If we win this, we're the champions!

425
00:25:49,048 --> 00:25:50,482
Let's do a quick cheer.

426
00:25:50,549 --> 00:25:51,750
One, two, three!

427
00:25:51,817 --> 00:25:54,286
