428
00:26:00,426 --> 00:26:04,763
One, two, one, two!

429
00:26:26,819 --> 00:26:29,621
Those dirty jerks tripped us!

430
00:26:29,688 --> 00:26:32,157
-Ref! Referee!
-It's no use.

431
00:26:32,224 --> 00:26:34,426
That ref is from Sangdurok-ri too.

432
00:26:34,493 --> 00:26:35,794
Stop it.

433
00:26:35,861 --> 00:26:36,762
-Bullshit.
-It's over.

434
00:26:36,829 --> 00:26:39,098
-It's all over.
-What do you mean, over?

435
00:26:39,164 --> 00:26:41,200
It's not over till it's over, right?

436
00:26:41,266 --> 00:26:43,135
Are you really going to end it here?

437
00:26:43,202 --> 00:26:44,470
Won't you get back up?

438
00:26:44,536 --> 00:26:47,072
Will you just watch
Sangdurok-ri win it all?

439
00:26:47,139 --> 00:26:49,208
-Bullshit, man!
-Get up!

440
00:26:49,274 --> 00:26:50,509
Let's go!

441
00:26:52,377 --> 00:26:54,113
With your favorite word, folks,

442
00:26:54,179 --> 00:26:56,048
