443
00:26:56,115 --> 00:26:57,683
"Bull" on one, "shit" on two.

444
00:26:57,749 --> 00:26:59,218
-Okay?
-Got it.

445
00:26:59,284 --> 00:27:00,786
All right, start!

446
00:27:00,853 --> 00:27:05,290
Bull, shit, bull, shit!

447
00:27:29,681 --> 00:27:31,683
Hey, we won, didn't we? Right?

448
00:27:31,750 --> 00:27:34,219
Yep, I tell you,
we barely turned it around!

449
00:27:34,286 --> 00:27:36,021
We're the champs, the champs!

450
00:27:36,088 --> 00:27:37,723
-Bullshit!

451
00:27:45,364 --> 00:27:47,366
What a load of crap!

452
00:27:47,432 --> 00:27:50,969
We came in about 1 cm ahead.

453
00:27:51,036 --> 00:27:55,240
I saw it with my own eyes!
We pulled ahead by 1.5 cm, got that?

454
00:27:55,908 --> 00:27:58,810
Hey, ref! We won, right?

455
00:27:58,877 --> 00:28:00,245
It was almost a tie…

456
00:28:00,312 --> 00:28:01,513
What do you mean?

457
00:28:01,580 --> 00:28:03,682
What are you saying? We came in first!

458
00:28:03,749 --> 00:28:06,118
-What did you say, punk?
-Damn it!

459
00:28:07,586 --> 00:28:10,122
We crossed the line first, you know.

460
00:28:10,189 --> 00:28:12,024
Um… Please quiet down.

461
00:28:12,090 --> 00:28:13,959
Luckily, our staff member here

462
00:28:14,026 --> 00:28:16,094
