463
00:28:16,161 --> 00:28:17,296
Right, right!

464
00:28:17,362 --> 00:28:20,766
So we will now conduct a photo review.

465
00:28:20,832 --> 00:28:25,037
Per international track rules,
the ruling goes by the torso here.

466
00:28:25,103 --> 00:28:27,639
The team whose torso
got across first wins.

467
00:28:27,706 --> 00:28:29,708
-No objections, right?
-Agreed.

468
00:28:29,775 --> 00:28:31,543
-Let's see it.
-Check the photo!

469
00:28:33,378 --> 00:28:35,180
Quiet down, please.

470
00:28:36,815 --> 00:28:38,717
-Zoom in on it.
-Yes, sir.

471
00:28:42,788 --> 00:28:46,325
Wait! Look at that chest!
That chest sticking way out!

472
00:28:46,391 --> 00:28:48,227
Gosh, you're right! It is!

473
00:28:48,293 --> 00:28:50,095
Didn't we win? Aren't we champs?

474
00:28:57,936 --> 00:28:59,738
Oh, damn it!

475
00:29:00,839 --> 00:29:03,275
That goddamn nipple!

476
00:29:03,342 --> 00:29:06,578
To think a nipple broke the tape!

477
00:29:06,645 --> 00:29:09,615
How is a guy's nipple
bigger than a woman's?

478
00:29:09,681 --> 00:29:11,183
Damn it all!

479
00:29:11,250 --> 00:29:13,151
Based on the photo review,

480
00:29:13,218 --> 00:29:15,554
the 10-person 11-legged race winner is…

481
00:29:15,621 --> 00:29:17,489
Hadurok-ri!

482
00:29:19,258 --> 00:29:21,760
Yes! Yes!

483
00:29:30,435 --> 00:29:31,970
Please stop, seriously!

484
00:29:32,037 --> 00:29:35,741
Hey! Your chest, that chest,
just won us the championship!

485
00:29:36,642 --> 00:29:40,412
Good thing that dog bit you, man!
What would we have done if it hadn't?

486
00:29:40,479 --> 00:29:43,915
Hey, you… No, this chest
is what saved our village!

487
00:29:43,982 --> 00:29:46,218
Clap, everyone, clap!

488
00:29:51,623 --> 00:29:54,259
Su-yeon is clapping for me.

489
00:29:54,326 --> 00:29:55,961
She's clapping…

490
00:29:56,928 --> 00:29:58,297
She smiled.

491
00:29:58,363 --> 00:30:02,734
She smiled! I'm all good now!
I've finally redeemed my image!

492
00:30:03,368 --> 00:30:06,138
Man, you're our village hero!

493
00:30:06,204 --> 00:30:08,073
A hero! A true hero!

494
00:30:09,408 --> 00:30:12,644
A hero? Am I really a hero?

495
00:30:20,085 --> 00:30:24,489
Um… I haven't seen them. Who are they?

496
00:30:24,556 --> 00:30:27,759
They moved here recently
to farm in our village. Why?

497
00:30:32,964 --> 00:30:34,700
Is that so?

498
00:30:37,569 --> 00:30:41,006
Now then, we will begin
the trophy presentation ceremony.

499
00:30:41,773 --> 00:30:46,778
The 25th Soul-myeon Sports Day
championship goes to Hadurok-ri!

500
