506
00:31:17,976 --> 00:31:20,846
Mister, what ineligible players? Who?

507
00:31:21,580 --> 00:31:25,350
Over there! Those bastards
who moved here to farm!

508
00:31:25,417 --> 00:31:28,587
-I think he's talking about us.
-You mean them?

509
00:31:28,653 --> 00:31:30,055
