register their address?

511
00:31:33,692 --> 00:31:35,961
Of course he did. No way he didn't.

512
00:31:38,330 --> 00:31:39,598
Mister.

513
00:31:39,664 --> 00:31:41,333
No half-wits move here to farm

514
00:31:41,400 --> 00:31:43,168
